OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fwet during the evening and overnight,
OL,7,Fwith a swathe of rain moving very
OL,8,Fslowly northwards before stalling over
OL,9,Fthe region, with some heavier spells
OL,10,Fpossible. Temperatures around average
OL,11,Fovernight. Breezy in places.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FA wet start with some
OL,14,Fheavier spells of rain. Both the cloud
OL,15,Fand the rain will clear to the south,
OL,16,Fto perhaps leave some late brighter
OL,17,Fspells. Temperatures near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
