OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FBreezy at first Thursday, but becoming
OL,7,Fdrier and eventually brighter into the
OL,8,Fweekend as temperatures fall away,
OL,9,Fwith overnight frosts developing
OL,10,Fwidely.
